WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.617
The inner query calculates average age across all
patients That

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:11.184
produces one number The outer WHERE clause compares
each patient age

00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:16.856
with that one benchmark Read the condition as a
sentence keep the patient

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:22.424
when age is greater than the average age returned by
the inner query Run

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.871
the query and compare the returned ages with the
full patient list
